# Cloud sync (Neon)

- **Backend:** [Neon](https://neon.tech): **Lakebase Postgres**, **Object Storage** (`.osp` snapshots and large assets), **Neon Auth** or the existing company sign-in for the viewer (decide in MynaHub before shipping).
- **Owner:** Only **MynaHub** talks to Neon. **MynaCAD** and **MynaOps** open the local `.osp` only; they never hold cloud keys. Project files are not pushed unless `OSAS_PUSH_PROJECT_FILES=1`.
- **Spec:** `docs/ODP-PROJECT-FILE-AND-SYNC.md`. **Create/connect Neon (dev):** `docs/CLOUD-NEON.md`.
- **Agents:** the **neon-postgres** plugin (Neon MCP and skills) is switched off for now (2026-11-11); do not rely on it. Turn it on again in the editor's plugin settings when sync service work starts.
